<title>INDIA: India July industrial production index up 5.2 pct.</title>
<headline>India July industrial production index up 5.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's 24-sector industrial production index rose 5.2 percent in July over the same month in 1995, the Industry Ministry said on Monday.  </p>
<p>	 Industry		   Percentage Change</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------</p>
<p>				 July	  April-July</p>
<p>				------     ---------------</p>
<p>				 1996	 1995    1996</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	 Electricity	  1.9	 12.4     2.1</p>
<p>	 Coal		  10.8	  9.8    10.5</p>
<p>	 Saleable Steel     4.7	 11.7     5.3</p>
<p>	 Crude Petroleum  -12.6	 22.3   -10.0</p>
<p>	 Petroleum</p>
<p>	 Refined Products   0.8	  7.0     5.2</p>
<p>	 Cement		12.1	 10.4    13.5</p>
<p>	 Steel Ingots	 5.0	  9.1     3.9</p>
<p>	 Nitrogenous Fert.  0.3	  8.8   -11.6</p>
<p>	 Phosphatic Fert.  -9.4	  2.7   -14.6</p>
<p>	 Pig Iron (saleable)</p>
<p>				 20.5	-30.3    21.4</p>
<p>	 Aluminium	   -2.6	 13.1    -5.8</p>
<p>	 Copper Cathodes  -54.4	 -7.0   -32.9</p>
<p>	 Sugar		 41.1	209.3    63.0</p>
<p>	 Salt		   0.1	 20.7     8.0</p>
<p>	 Cloth (Mill)	13.5	-13.2    16.7</p>
<p>	 Cloth (Decentralised)</p>
<p>				  9.7	  1.2     6.3</p>
<p>	 Cotton Yarn	 11.1	  6.3     6.7</p>
<p>	 Jute Manufactures</p>
<p>				-19.8	  8.0   -10.3</p>
<p>	 Commercial Vehicles</p>
<p>				 18.6	 37.5    21.6</p>
<p>	 Cars		  16.6	 32.6    23.7</p>
<p>	 Jeeps		 33.2	 53.3    17.0</p>
<p>	 Motorcycles	 37.2	 28.8    26.6</p>
<p>	 Autorickshaws     37.1	 31.9    45.6</p>
<p>	 Scooters/Mopeds   25.4	 17.9    22.8</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	 OVERALL		5.2	 13.2     5.8</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Note: The figures are provisional and</p>
<p>incorporate updated data of earlier months.</p>
</text>
